  "rules": "Cracked salt crust holds you once: when you step off a cracked tile it collapses into a brine pit for as long as you stay on the map. Three salt plates (L1-L3) glow while you stand on or have crossed them, but they go dark again if the crust is reset. When all three glow at once the seal crystal (s1) lights for good and the twin gates G1/G2 open. Stepping into a brine pit washes you back to the entrance and restores the crust (plates go dark). The reset crystal R1 does the same. One-way ledges at both sides of the gate wall are the shortcut back to the entrance.",
